<title>MEXICO: Mexico's TMM 9-mo net income slips.</title>
<headline>Mexico's TMM 9-mo net income slips.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			  1995</p>
<p>	Shr		     US$0.42		  US$0.58</p>
<p>	Oper Income	  39.5 million		 50.2 million</p>
<p>	Net		    23.76 million		31.64 million</p>
<p>	Revs		  533.3 million		552.0 million</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in U.S. dollars.</p>
<p>TMM is also traded as an American Depositary Receipt and each ADR is equivalent to one share on the Mexican bolsa.</p>
<p>Full company name is Transportacion Maritima Mexicana SA de CV.</p>
